<h2 id="4.-Part-B-%E2%80%94-PMI-with-RDDs:-stripes">4. Part B — PMI with RDDs: stripes<a class="anchor-link" href="#4.-Part-B-%E2%80%94-PMI-with-RDDs:-stripes">¶</a></h2>
</div>
